$DIR/main.p:6:5: //pu:percpu variable ticks needs --mode kernel
    //pu:percpu variables are reached through the GS segment register, which
    only a kernel sets up. Build with --mode kernel, or remove the directive.
    (see "Per-CPU variables" in the Plutonium spec, section 20.9)
    (run "pluto explain E2551" for a longer explanation)
